iveReview":"pending"},"examples":[],"levelEstimated":false,"origin":"/Users/zenray/.claude/tmp/tmp-zenray-japanese/research/japan/JapanAdvancedRecords.json","corpus":"japan","recordShard":179,"markdown":"## japan-adv-meiji-industry : Quels secteurs montrent la transformation industrielle de Meiji ? (12 October 2026)\n\nDomaine : history ; niveau : culture ; statut : source-reviewed-draft. (12 October 2026)\n\nLes sites de la révolution industrielle Meiji documentent surtout le fer et l’acier, la construction navale et l’extraction du charbon. Les composantes montrent des transferts techniques depuis l’Europe et l’Amérique, puis leur adaptation aux besoins locaux, entre le milieu du XIXe et le début du XXe siècle. Il s’agit d’une histoire de systèmes de production et d’apprentissage technique. (12 October 2026)\n\n- [Sites of Japan Meiji Industrial Revolution](https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1484/) ; UNESCO World Heritage Centre ; Property descriptions display CC-BY-SA IGO 3.0. Photographs, maps and nomination files have separate rights. ; vérifié : 12 October 2026. (12 October 2026)\n"},{"id":"word-1004970","title":"ごった返す","aliases":["ごった返す","ごったがえす"],"domain":"dictionary","level":"unclassified","levelEstimated":false,"status":"source-imported","explanationFr":"EN : to be in confusion or commotion; EN : to be in a turmoil; EN : to be crowded or jammed with people [Godan verb with 'su' ending, intransitive verb]","glossLanguages":["eng"],"senses":[{"partOfSpeech":["v5s","vi"],"appliesToKanji":["*"],"appliesToKana":["*"],"related":[],"antonym":[],"field":[],"dialect":[],"misc":[],"info":[],"languageSource":[],"gloss":[{"lang":"eng","gender":null,"type":null,"text":"to be in confusion or commotion"},{"lang":"eng","gender":null,"type":null,"text":"to be in a turmoil"},{"lang":"eng","gender":null,"type":null,"text":"to be crowded or jammed with people"}]}],"examples":[],"prerequisites":[],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project.html",